{"seq":2,"slug":"data-governance","title":"数据治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-engineering-practice/data-governance","wordCount":1061,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据治理\">数据治理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>数据治理是确保企业数据资产&quot;可信、可用、可控&quot;的管理体系。随着数据量爆发式增长和隐私法规趋严，数据治理已从&quot;锦上添花&quot;变为企业合规运营的刚需。大数据工程师需要理解治理框架并能落地技术实现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据标准制定\">数据标准制定</h3><p>数据标准是治理体系的基石，确保全组织对同一概念的理解一致：</p>\n<p><strong>命名规范</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>命名规则</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据库</td>\n<td>业务域缩写 + 用途</td>\n<td><code>dw_trade</code>, <code>ods_user</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表名</td>\n<td>层级_主题_粒度_周期</td>\n<td><code>dws_order_user_1d</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段名</td>\n<td>小写下划线，业务含义明确</td>\n<td><code>order_create_time</code>, <code>pay_amount</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标</td>\n<td>修饰词_原子指标_时间周期</td>\n<td><code>new_user_cnt_7d</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>指标口径标准化</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 指标定义文件（metrics.yaml）&#10;metrics:&#10;  - name: daily_active_users&#10;    display_name: &#39;日活跃用户数&#39;&#10;    definition: &#39;当日有至少 1 次有效行为的去重用户数&#39;&#10;    formula: &quot;COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) WHERE event_time &gt;= T AND event_time &lt; T+1d AND event_type NOT IN (&#39;bot&#39;, &#39;test&#39;)&quot;&#10;    dimensions: [&#39;platform&#39;, &#39;channel&#39;, &#39;country&#39;]&#10;    owner: &#39;growth-team&#39;&#10;    data_source: &#39;dws_user_behavior_1d&#39;&#10;    update_frequency: &#39;daily&#39;&#10;    sla: &#39;T+1 08:00 前可用&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 指标定义文件（metrics.yaml）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">daily_active_users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    display_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'日活跃用户数'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    definition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'当日有至少 1 次有效行为的去重用户数'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    formula</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) WHERE event_time >= T AND event_time &#x3C; T+1d AND event_type NOT IN ('bot', 'test')\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    dimensions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'platform'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'channel'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'country'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'growth-team'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    data_source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dws_user_behavior_1d'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    update_frequency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'daily'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    sla</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'T+1 08:00 前可用'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>统一的指标口径解决了企业中最常见的数据痛点——&quot;同一个指标，不同部门算出不同数字&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"元数据管理\">元数据管理</h3><p>元数据是&quot;关于数据的数据&quot;，包括技术元数据（表结构、存储位置）和业务元数据（含义、负责人）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    TM[&quot;技术元数据&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;Schema 信息&lt;br/&gt;字段类型/约束&quot;]&#10;    TM --&gt; L[&quot;存储位置&lt;br/&gt;HDFS 路径/分区&quot;]&#10;    TM --&gt; P[&quot;处理信息&lt;br/&gt;ETL 作业/调度&quot;]&#10;    BM[&quot;业务元数据&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;数据字典&lt;br/&gt;字段含义/取值&quot;]&#10;    BM --&gt; O[&quot;归属信息&lt;br/&gt;负责人/团队&quot;]&#10;    BM --&gt; Q[&quot;质量信息&lt;br/&gt;SLA/完整性&quot;]\">graph TB\n    TM[\"技术元数据\"] --&gt; S[\"Schema 信息&lt;br/&gt;字段类型/约束\"]\n    TM --&gt; L[\"存储位置&lt;br/&gt;HDFS 路径/分区\"]\n    TM --&gt; P[\"处理信息&lt;br/&gt;ETL 作业/调度\"]\n    BM[\"业务元数据\"] --&gt; D[\"数据字典&lt;br/&gt;字段含义/取值\"]\n    BM --&gt; O[\"归属信息&lt;br/&gt;负责人/团队\"]\n    BM --&gt; Q[\"质量信息&lt;br/&gt;SLA/完整性\"]</pre><p><strong>元数据平台核心功能</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Apache Atlas 风格的元数据注册&#10;metadata = {&#10;    &quot;table&quot;: &quot;dws_order_user_1d&quot;,&#10;    &quot;database&quot;: &quot;dw_trade&quot;,&#10;    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;用户维度订单日汇总表&quot;,&#10;    &quot;owner&quot;: &quot;data-warehouse-team&quot;,&#10;    &quot;columns&quot;: [&#10;        {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;user_id&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;STRING&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;用户唯一标识&quot;, &quot;pii&quot;: False},&#10;        {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;order_count&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;INT&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;当日订单数&quot;},&#10;        {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;total_amount&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;DECIMAL(12,2)&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;当日消费总额&quot;},&#10;        {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;phone&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;STRING&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;手机号&quot;, &quot;pii&quot;: True, &quot;mask&quot;: &quot;PARTIAL&quot;}&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;partition_key&quot;: &quot;dt&quot;,&#10;    &quot;storage_format&quot;: &quot;PARQUET&quot;,&#10;    &quot;update_schedule&quot;: &quot;daily 03:00&quot;,&#10;    &quot;retention_days&quot;: 365,&#10;    &quot;classification&quot;: [&quot;INTERNAL&quot;, &quot;CONTAINS_PII&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Apache Atlas 风格的元数据注册</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">metadata </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"table\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dws_order_user_1d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"database\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dw_trade\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"用户维度订单日汇总表\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"data-warehouse-team\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"columns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"STRING\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"用户唯一标识\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pii\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"当日订单数\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DECIMAL(12,2)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"当日消费总额\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"phone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"STRING\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"手机号\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pii\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mask\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PARTIAL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"partition_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"storage_format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PARQUET\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"update_schedule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"daily 03:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"retention_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">365</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"classification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INTERNAL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CONTAINS_PII\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"数据血缘追踪\">数据血缘追踪</h3><p>数据血缘记录数据的来源、流转和依赖关系，回答&quot;这个指标是怎么算出来的&quot;：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    T1[&quot;ods_order_raw&lt;br/&gt;MySQL binlog&quot;] --&gt; T2[&quot;dwd_order_detail&lt;br/&gt;清洗/维度关联&quot;]&#10;    T3[&quot;ods_user_profile&lt;br/&gt;API 采集&quot;] --&gt; T2&#10;    T2 --&gt; T4[&quot;dws_order_user_1d&lt;br/&gt;用户日汇总&quot;]&#10;    T2 --&gt; T5[&quot;dws_order_category_1d&lt;br/&gt;品类日汇总&quot;]&#10;    T4 --&gt; T6[&quot;ads_user_value&lt;br/&gt;用户价值分层&quot;]&#10;    T5 --&gt; T7[&quot;ads_category_report&lt;br/&gt;品类经营报表&quot;]\">graph LR\n    T1[\"ods_order_raw&lt;br/&gt;MySQL binlog\"] --&gt; T2[\"dwd_order_detail&lt;br/&gt;清洗/维度关联\"]\n    T3[\"ods_user_profile&lt;br/&gt;API 采集\"] --&gt; T2\n    T2 --&gt; T4[\"dws_order_user_1d&lt;br/&gt;用户日汇总\"]\n    T2 --&gt; T5[\"dws_order_category_1d&lt;br/&gt;品类日汇总\"]\n    T4 --&gt; T6[\"ads_user_value&lt;br/&gt;用户价值分层\"]\n    T5 --&gt; T7[\"ads_category_report&lt;br/&gt;品类经营报表\"]</pre><p>血缘追踪的实际价值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>影响分析</strong>：上游表结构变更时，快速定位所有受影响的下游</li>\n<li><strong>根因定位</strong>：报表数据异常时，沿血缘链路向上追溯找到问题源头</li>\n<li><strong>合规审计</strong>：证明个人数据的完整处理链路符合隐私法规</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"数据安全策略\">数据安全策略</h3><p>数据安全覆盖访问控制、脱敏、加密和审计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 数据脱敏策略实现&#10;class DataMasker:&#10;    STRATEGIES = {&#10;        &#39;phone&#39;: lambda v: v[:3] + &#39;****&#39; + v[7:] if v else None,&#10;        &#39;email&#39;: lambda v: v.split(&#39;@&#39;)[0][:2] + &#39;***@&#39; + v.split(&#39;@&#39;)[1] if &#39;@&#39; in str(v) else None,&#10;        &#39;id_card&#39;: lambda v: v[:4] + &#39;**********&#39; + v[-4:] if v and len(v) == 18 else None,&#10;        &#39;name&#39;: lambda v: v[0] + &#39;*&#39; * (len(v) - 1) if v else None,&#10;        &#39;bank_card&#39;: lambda v: &#39;****&#39; + v[-4:] if v else None,&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    def mask_dataframe(self, df, column_policies):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        column_policies: {&#39;phone&#39;: &#39;phone&#39;, &#39;email&#39;: &#39;email&#39;, &#39;real_name&#39;: &#39;name&#39;}&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        masked_df = df.copy()&#10;        for col, strategy in column_policies.items():&#10;            if col in masked_df.columns and strategy in self.STRATEGIES:&#10;                masked_df[col] = masked_df[col].apply(self.STRATEGIES[strategy])&#10;        return masked_df&#10;&#10;# 行级权限控制（Row-Level Security）&#10;# 不同角色只能看到自己负责区域的数据&#10;ROLE_FILTERS = {&#10;    &#39;regional_manager_east&#39;: &quot;region IN (&#39;华东&#39;, &#39;华南&#39;)&quot;,&#10;    &#39;regional_manager_west&#39;: &quot;region IN (&#39;西南&#39;, &#39;西北&#39;)&quot;,&#10;    &#39;data_analyst&#39;: &quot;1=1&quot;,  # 全量访问&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 数据脱敏策略实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><